  "title": "RESERVOIR ANNOUNCES PUBLISHING DEAL WITH JADY FRONTMAN JARRETT DOHERTY",
  "summary": "Deal is the first signing via new joint venture with Reservoir writer Sam Tinnesz’ Tinman Reservoir Media, Inc. (NASDAQ: RSVR), an award-winning independent music company, today announced a publishing deal with singer-songwriter Jarrett Doherty, the frontman of alt-pop/rock duo Jady. The agreement, which includes Doherty’s full catalog and future works, marks his first publishing deal […]",
